[Thd 27708 CPU 8 8/13/26 16:05:08.970] Purpose:
[Thd 27708 CPU 8 8/13/26 16:05:08.970] + Optionally join trials with given run_name and index ranges [ga,gb] [ta,tb]...
[Thd 27708 CPU 8 8/13/26 16:05:08.970] + ...Or run on any individual file.
[Thd 27708 CPU 8 8/13/26 16:05:08.970] + Optionally apply demultiplexing corrections.
[Thd 27708 CPU 8 8/13/26 16:05:08.970] + Optionally apply band-pass and global CAR filters.
[Thd 27708 CPU 8 8/13/26 16:05:08.970] + Optionally edit out saturation artifacts.
[Thd 27708 CPU 8 8/13/26 16:05:08.970] + Optionally extract tables of sync waveform edge times to drive TPrime.
[Thd 27708 CPU 8 8/13/26 16:05:08.970] + Optionally extract tables of other nonneural event times to be aligned with spikes.
[Thd 27708 CPU 8 8/13/26 16:05:08.971] + Optionally join the above outputs across different runs (supercat feature).

[Thd 27708 CPU 8 8/13/26 16:05:08.971] Output:
[Thd 27708 CPU 8 8/13/26 16:05:08.971] + Results are placed next to source, named like this, with t-index = tcat:
[Thd 27708 CPU 8 8/13/26 16:05:08.971] +    path/run_name_g5_tcat.imec1.ap.bin.
[Thd 27708 CPU 8 8/13/26 16:05:08.971] + Errors and run messages are appended to CatGT.log in the current working directory.

[Thd 27708 CPU 8 8/13/26 16:05:08.971] Usage:
[Thd 27708 CPU 8 8/13/26 16:05:08.971] >CatGT -dir=data_dir -run=run_name -g=ga,gb -t=ta,tb <which streams> [ options ]

