[Thd 8872 CPU 10 8/13/26 16:05:15.497] Purpose:
[Thd 8872 CPU 10 8/13/26 16:05:15.497] + Optionally join trials with given run_name and index ranges [ga,gb] [ta,tb]...
[Thd 8872 CPU 10 8/13/26 16:05:15.497] + ...Or run on any individual file.
[Thd 8872 CPU 10 8/13/26 16:05:15.497] + Optionally apply demultiplexing corrections.
[Thd 8872 CPU 10 8/13/26 16:05:15.498] + Optionally apply band-pass and global CAR filters.
[Thd 8872 CPU 10 8/13/26 16:05:15.498] + Optionally edit out saturation artifacts.
[Thd 8872 CPU 10 8/13/26 16:05:15.498] + Optionally extract tables of sync waveform edge times to drive TPrime.
[Thd 8872 CPU 10 8/13/26 16:05:15.498] + Optionally extract tables of other nonneural event times to be aligned with spikes.
[Thd 8872 CPU 10 8/13/26 16:05:15.498] + Optionally join the above outputs across different runs (supercat feature).

[Thd 8872 CPU 10 8/13/26 16:05:15.498] Output:
[Thd 8872 CPU 10 8/13/26 16:05:15.498] + Results are placed next to source, named like this, with t-index = tcat:
[Thd 8872 CPU 10 8/13/26 16:05:15.498] +    path/run_name_g5_tcat.imec1.ap.bin.
[Thd 8872 CPU 10 8/13/26 16:05:15.498] + Errors and run messages are appended to CatGT.log in the current working directory.

