[Thd 33892 CPU 8 8/13/26 16:05:58.053] Purpose:
[Thd 33892 CPU 8 8/13/26 16:05:58.054] + Optionally join trials with given run_name and index ranges [ga,gb] [ta,tb]...
[Thd 33892 CPU 8 8/13/26 16:05:58.054] + ...Or run on any individual file.
[Thd 33892 CPU 8 8/13/26 16:05:58.054] + Optionally apply demultiplexing corrections.
[Thd 33892 CPU 8 8/13/26 16:05:58.054] + Optionally apply band-pass and global CAR filters.
[Thd 33892 CPU 8 8/13/26 16:05:58.054] + Optionally edit out saturation artifacts.
[Thd 33892 CPU 8 8/13/26 16:05:58.054] + Optionally extract tables of sync waveform edge times to drive TPrime.
[Thd 33892 CPU 8 8/13/26 16:05:58.054] + Optionally extract tables of other nonneural event times to be aligned with spikes.
[Thd 33892 CPU 8 8/13/26 16:05:58.054] + Optionally join the above outputs across different runs (supercat feature).

[Thd 33892 CPU 8 8/13/26 16:05:58.055] Output:
[Thd 33892 CPU 8 8/13/26 16:05:58.055] + Results are placed next to source, named like this, with t-index = tcat:
