[Thd 23980 CPU 0 8/13/26 16:06:06.248] Purpose:
[Thd 23980 CPU 0 8/13/26 16:06:06.248] + Optionally join trials with given run_name and index ranges [ga,gb] [ta,tb]...
[Thd 23980 CPU 0 8/13/26 16:06:06.248] + ...Or run on any individual file.
[Thd 23980 CPU 0 8/13/26 16:06:06.248] + Optionally apply demultiplexing corrections.
[Thd 23980 CPU 0 8/13/26 16:06:06.249] + Optionally apply band-pass and global CAR filters.
[Thd 23980 CPU 10 8/13/26 16:06:06.249] + Optionally edit out saturation artifacts.
[Thd 23980 CPU 10 8/13/26 16:06:06.249] + Optionally extract tables of sync waveform edge times to drive TPrime.
[Thd 23980 CPU 10 8/13/26 16:06:06.249] + Optionally extract tables of other nonneural event times to be aligned with spikes.
[Thd 23980 CPU 10 8/13/26 16:06:06.249] + Optionally join the above outputs across different runs (supercat feature).

[Thd 23980 CPU 10 8/13/26 16:06:06.249] Output:
