[Thd 9576 CPU 2 8/13/26 16:06:06.527] + Optionally apply demultiplexing corrections.
[Thd 9576 CPU 10 8/13/26 16:06:06.528] + Optionally apply band-pass and global CAR filters.
[Thd 9576 CPU 10 8/13/26 16:06:06.528] + Optionally edit out saturation artifacts.
[Thd 9576 CPU 10 8/13/26 16:06:06.528] + Optionally extract tables of sync waveform edge times to drive TPrime.
[Thd 9576 CPU 10 8/13/26 16:06:06.528] + Optionally extract tables of other nonneural event times to be aligned with spikes.
