[Thd 29152 CPU 8 8/13/26 16:06:06.839] *** ERROR: MISSING CRITICAL PARAMETERS ***
[Thd 29152 CPU 8 8/13/26 16:06:06.839] ------------------------
[Thd 29152 CPU 8 8/13/26 16:06:06.839] Purpose:
[Thd 29152 CPU 8 8/13/26 16:06:06.839] + Optionally join trials with given run_name and index ranges [ga,gb] [ta,tb]...
[Thd 29152 CPU 8 8/13/26 16:06:06.839] + ...Or run on any individual file.
[Thd 29152 CPU 8 8/13/26 16:06:06.839] + Optionally apply demultiplexing corrections.
[Thd 29152 CPU 8 8/13/26 16:06:06.839] + Optionally apply band-pass and global CAR filters.
[Thd 29152 CPU 8 8/13/26 16:06:06.839] + Optionally edit out saturation artifacts.
[Thd 29152 CPU 8 8/13/26 16:06:06.841] + Optionally extract tables of sync waveform edge times to drive TPrime.
[Thd 29152 CPU 8 8/13/26 16:06:06.841] + Optionally extract tables of other nonneural event times to be aligned with spikes.
[Thd 29152 CPU 8 8/13/26 16:06:06.841] + Optionally join the above outputs across different runs (supercat feature).

[Thd 29152 CPU 8 8/13/26 16:06:06.841] Output:
[Thd 29152 CPU 8 8/13/26 16:06:06.841] + Results are placed next to source, named like this, with t-index = tcat:
[Thd 29152 CPU 8 8/13/26 16:06:06.841] +    path/run_name_g5_tcat.imec1.ap.bin.
[Thd 29152 CPU 8 8/13/26 16:06:06.841] + Errors and run messages are appended to CatGT.log in the current working directory.

[Thd 29152 CPU 8 8/13/26 16:06:06.841] Usage:
[Thd 29152 CPU 8 8/13/26 16:06:06.842] >CatGT -dir=data_dir -run=run_name -g=ga,gb -t=ta,tb <which streams> [ options ]

[Thd 29152 CPU 8 8/13/26 16:06:06.842] Which streams:
[Thd 29152 CPU 8 8/13/26 16:06:06.842] -ni                      ;required to process ni stream
[Thd 29152 CPU 8 8/13/26 16:06:06.842] -ob                      ;required to process ob streams
[Thd 29152 CPU 8 8/13/26 16:06:06.842] -ap                      ;required to process ap streams
[Thd 29152 CPU 8 8/13/26 16:06:06.842] -lf                      ;required to process lf streams
[Thd 29152 CPU 8 8/13/26 16:06:06.842] -obx=0,3:5               ;if -ob process these OneBoxes
[Thd 29152 CPU 8 8/13/26 16:06:06.842] -prb_3A                  ;if -ap or -lf process 3A-style probe files, e.g., run_name_g0_t0.imec.ap.bin
[Thd 29152 CPU 8 8/13/26 16:06:06.842] -prb=0,3:5               ;if -ap or -lf AND !prb_3A process these probes

[Thd 29152 CPU 8 8/13/26 16:06:06.842] Options:
[Thd 29152 CPU 8 8/13/26 16:06:06.842] -no_run_fld              ;older data, or data files relocated without a run folder
[Thd 29152 CPU 8 8/13/26 16:06:06.842] -prb_fld                 ;input has folder-per-probe organization
[Thd 29152 CPU 12 8/13/26 16:06:06.842] -prb_miss_ok             ;instead of stopping, silently skip missing probes
[Thd 29152 CPU 12 8/13/26 16:06:06.842] -gtlist={gj,tja,tjb}     ;override {-g,-t} giving each listed g-index its own t-range
[Thd 29152 CPU 12 8/13/26 16:06:06.844] -t=cat                   ;extract events from CatGT output files (instead of -t=ta,tb)
[Thd 29152 CPU 12 8/13/26 16:06:06.844] -exported                ;apply FileViewer 'exported' tag to in/output filenames
[Thd 29152 CPU 12 8/13/26 16:06:06.844] -t_miss_ok               ;instead of stopping, zero-fill if trial missing
[Thd 29152 CPU 12 8/13/26 16:06:06.844] -zerofillmax=500         ;set a maximum zero-fill span (millisec)
[Thd 29152 CPU 12 8/13/26 16:06:06.844] -no_linefill             ;disable overwriting zero fills with line fills
[Thd 29152 CPU 12 8/13/26 16:06:06.844] -startsecs=120.0         ;skip this initial span of each input stream (float seconds)
[Thd 29152 CPU 12 8/13/26 16:06:06.844] -maxsecs=7.5             ;set a maximum output file length (float seconds)
[Thd 29152 CPU 12 8/13/26 16:06:06.844] -apfilter=Typ,N,Fhi,Flo  ;apply ap band-pass filter of given {type, order, corners(float Hz)}
[Thd 29152 CPU 12 8/13/26 16:06:06.845] -lffilter=Typ,N,Fhi,Flo  ;apply lf band-pass filter of given {type, order, corners(float Hz)}
[Thd 29152 CPU 12 8/13/26 16:06:06.845] -ap2lf_dwnsmp=12         ;down-sample factor when converting ap to lf file
[Thd 29152 CPU 12 8/13/26 16:06:06.845] -no_tshift               ;DO NOT time-align channels to account for ADC multiplexing
[Thd 29152 CPU 12 8/13/26 16:06:06.845] -loccar_um=40,140        ;apply ap local CAR annulus (exclude radius, include radius)
